      "name": "Dusting",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The pachinyam shakes it thick fur and releases a cloud of dust and dander in a 5ft Type:burst radius centered on a corner of one of its squares that functions as a mist spell. This dust cloud blocks electronic communication to and from anyone inside the cloud. Any item with the tech trait becomes glitching 1 if it's inside the dust cloud. The pachinyam can't use this ability again until they take a dust bath as a 3-action activity with the move trait.</p>",
